MXB Coach spoken cue clips (src/voice/*.wav, embedded in mxbcoach.dlo)
  Generated offline by tools/voice/make_clips.py with Piper text-to-speech
  (https://github.com/OHF-Voice/piper1-gpl), using the voice "en_US-ljspeech-high"
  from https://huggingface.co/rhasspy/piper-voices (MIT License).
  The voice was trained from scratch on the LJ Speech dataset by Keith Ito and
  Linda Johnson (https://keithito.com/LJ-Speech-Dataset/), which is in the public
  domain. Voice training by Bryce Beattie (https://brycebeattie.com/files/tts/).
  Piper is only used to make the clips and isn't shipped; its licence doesn't
  cover the audio it outputs.

MXB Coach HUD font (src/font/coach.fnt, embedded in mxbcoach.dlo)
  Roboto Mono, rasterised into PiBoSo's .fnt bitmap-font format. The plugin
  writes it beside itself and registers it in DrawInit, which is the only way a
  PiBoSo plugin can draw text at all.

